| Mục | Nội dung |
|---|---|
| Actor | Chuyên viên |
| Route | `/workspace/ho-so/:id` |
| Màn | EXP-01 `/workspace/ho-so-cua-toi`; EXP-05 inbox `/workspace/ho-so-phoi-hop`; EXP-02..06 trên dossier-detail |
